00:10:02.001 --> 00:10:05.004
If you do save some money and you got it,

00:10:05.004 --> 00:10:06.272
where should you invest it

00:10:06.272 --> 00:10:08.207
now rather than investing?

00:10:08.207 --> 00:10:09.241
The first thing you have to do

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:10.309
is make sure you're out of credit

00:10:10.309 --> 00:10:11.344
card debt. Right.

00:10:11.344 --> 00:10:12.678
Because at these interest rates,

00:10:12.678 --> 00:10:14.113
with the Fed raising interest rates

00:10:14.113 --> 00:10:14.513
so high,

00:10:14.513 --> 00:10:16.616
many of you are paying in your 20%.

00:10:16.616 --> 00:10:18.651
So you first get out of credit card debt.

00:10:18.651 --> 00:10:18.985
Okay.

00:10:18.985 --> 00:10:19.785
Next,

00:10:19.785 --> 00:10:20.753
any money market

00:10:20.753 --> 00:10:22.355
fund, any credit union,

00:10:22.355 --> 00:10:23.923
any savings account

00:10:23.923 --> 00:10:27.360
that's paying you now 4%, 5%.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.295
Right. Whatever it may be.

00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:30.162
That's where you would

00:10:30.162 --> 00:10:31.263
be saving it right now.

